+           column  Caso
+           column  Codice
+           column  Messaggio
+           column  Nota
+           row  `Truncated(offset)`  1  _the message ends at offset `offset`, inside a field_  un messaggio malformato
+           row  `BadPointer(offset)`  2  _the name pointer at offset `offset` points forward_  un messaggio malformato
+           row  `BadLabel(offset, kind)`  3  _the label at offset `offset` has unsupported type `kind`_  un messaggio malformato
+           row  `LongLabel(label)`  4  _the label `label` is longer than 63 octets_  un nome errato
+           row  `LongName(name)`  5  _the name `name` is longer than 255 octets_  un nome errato
+           row  `EmptyLabel(text)`  6  _the name `text` contains an empty label_  un nome errato
+           row  `BadEscape(text)`  7  _the name `text` contains a malformed escape sequence_  un nome errato
+           row  `BadRdata(rtype, offset)`  8  _the `rtype` record data at offset `offset` is malformed_  un messaggio malformato
+           row  `LongString(length)`  9  _a character-string of `length` octets exceeds 255_  una stringa TXT
+           row  `Trailing(offset)`  10  _the message has trailing bytes from offset `offset`_  un messaggio malformato
+           row  `Unresolved(name)`  11  _the name `name` could not be resolved_  da `Dns.resolve`
+           row  `Timeout`  12  _no response arrived before the timeout_  sollevato da un trasporto come `coaxial.dns`
+           row  `Mismatch(id)`  13  _the response with ID `id` does not answer the query_  sollevato da un trasporto, per una risposta con l'ID sbagliato

